mberships.
     *   Naming Conventions and Identification: Kelly explained that naming=
 conventions, such as the absence of a state identifier, can help distingui=
sh countrywide forms from state-specific ones when aggregating data from va=
rious sources.
     *   Mock Data and Knowledge Base Creation: Kevin suggested starting wi=
th a small set of mock forms to build a knowledge base and test integration=
, with the goal of connecting this data to the Transformation Bridge tool f=
or demonstration purposes.
